@FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5124

### Criar título
# @name createAsset
POST {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CDB Banco XYZ",
  "issuer": "Banco XYZ",
  "assetType": "Cdb",
  "indexType": "PreFixed",
  "rate": 12,
  "issueDate": "2025-01-01",
  "maturityDate": "2027-01-01"
}

### Listar títulos
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets
Accept: application/json

### Detalhar título
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets/{{createAsset.response.body.$.data.id}}
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar título
PUT {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets/{{createAsset.response.body.$.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CDB Banco XYZ Prefixado",
  "issuer": "Banco XYZ",
  "rate": 13,
  "issueDate": "2025-01-01",
  "maturityDate": "2027-01-01"
}

### Registrar aporte
# @name createPosition
POST {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/positions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": "{{createAsset.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "investedAmount": 1000,
  "applicationDate": "2025-06-01"
}

### Listar aportes
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/positions
Accept: application/json

### Projeção do aporte
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/positions/{{createPosition.response.body.$.data.id}}/projection?referenceDate=2026-06-01
Accept: application/json

### Remover título (rejeitado: título já possui aportes)
DELETE {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets/{{createAsset.response.body.$.data.id}}

### Resumo consolidado da carteira
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/portfolio/summary?referenceDate=2026-06-01
Accept: application/json

### Cotações de CDI no período (data inicial incluída, final incluída na consulta)
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/indexes/Cdi?from=2026-09-14&to=2026-09-18
Accept: application/json

### Cotações de IPCA no período (uma por mês, com data no dia 1)
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/indexes/Ipca?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-09-01
Accept: application/json

### Indexador sem cotação (rejeitado: PreFixed)
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/indexes/PreFixed?from=2026-09-14&to=2026-09-18
Accept: application/json

### Criar CDB pós-fixado em CDI (rate = % do CDI)
# @name createCdiAsset
POST {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CDB Banco XYZ 100% CDI",
  "issuer": "Banco XYZ",
  "assetType": "Cdb",
  "indexType": "Cdi",
  "rate": 100,
  "issueDate": "2026-06-01",
  "maturityDate": "2027-06-01"
}

### Registrar aporte no CDB em CDI
# @name createCdiPosition
POST {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/positions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": "{{createCdiAsset.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "investedAmount": 1000,
  "applicationDate": "2026-06-01"
}

### Projeção do CDB em CDI (exige cotações de CDI cobrindo o período)
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/positions/{{createCdiPosition.response.body.$.data.id}}/projection?referenceDate=2026-09-23
Accept: application/json

### Criar CDB IPCA+ (rate = taxa real anual)
# @name createIpcaAsset
POST {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CDB Banco XYZ IPCA+6%",
  "issuer": "Banco XYZ",
  "assetType": "Cdb",
  "indexType": "Ipca",
  "rate": 6,
  "issueDate": "2026-01-01",
  "maturityDate": "2028-01-01"
}

### Registrar aporte no CDB IPCA+
# @name createIpcaPosition
POST {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/positions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": "{{createIpcaAsset.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "investedAmount": 1000,
  "applicationDate": "2026-04-01"
}

### Projeção do CDB IPCA+ (isEstimated indica mês sem IPCA divulgado)
GET {{FixedIncome.Api_HostAddress}}/api/positions/{{createIpcaPosition.response.body.$.data.id}}/projection?referenceDate=2026-07-01
Accept: application/json

###
